    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d249-a3">

                <pb facs="0363" n="257" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg257"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 246.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Egan to Mr.
                            McCreery</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-12-01"><hi rendition="#italic">December 1,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In reference to the case of Patrick
                    Shields, fireman of the United States ship <hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Keweenaw</hi>, I have received from the honorable minister of foreign relations
                    a reply to my note on this matter in which he says: “Solely as a matter of
                    deference <pb facs="0364" n="258" xml:id="pg258"/> to the representative of the
                    United States, and without giving to it the force of a precedent in this matter,
                    the ministry requests the indispensable reports upon the following points: <list>
                        <item>“(1) Ill treatment of Shields.</item>
                        <item>“(2) How and when was he put in prison?</item>
                        <item>“(3) What judicial investigations were made or omitted to be made, on
                            shore or on board ship?</item>
                        <item>“(4) Some peculiar circumstance which may have occurred in this
                            matter.”</item>
                    </list></p>
                <p>Please report to me promptly and fully on above matter.</p>
                <p>I remain, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Patrick Egan</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
